\fBR.QNORM(p, mean, sd, [lower_tail], [log_p])\fR \(-> number
the quantile of the normal distribution of mean \[u03BC] and standard deviation \[u03C3]: the x with P(X \[u2264] x) = p, or of P(X > x) (lower_tail = FALSE), p may be a logarithm (log_p)
